    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Become a reactor operator</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In Reactor in danger you can control prototype of real reactor with realistic controls.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Realistic reactor physics</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">While calculating reactor physics taken a lot of parameters which team need to control and change depending on current situation </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Team work</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">For controlling difficult mechanism like reactor there need a team of 2-4 players for synchronous controlling different tasks.</p>",
